# Next rewrites this on every dev/build, pointing at whichever of `.next/types` or
# `.next/dev/types` the last command produced — so a tracked copy is dirty half the
# time. It is generated, `.next` is ignored anyway, and both playground-next and the
# site type-check cleanly without it.
